The hint exposed the easy preset: Gemini produced a valid witness on the first hinted attempt. G9(b) therefore fails at the current shipping level regardless of the remaining two calls. I’m letting the script finish its three-attempt record, then I’ll use the single permitted move to `medium` and rerun both bare and hinted there; if the hint breaks medium too, the family must be rejected.
